### ============================================
### MASTER AUTH - Autenticación Centralizada
### ============================================

### Login centralizado (no requiere API key)
### Usa usuarios de la tabla masterUsers de la base master
POST {{baseURL}}/master/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin@empresa_demo",
    "password": "password123"
}

### ============================================

### Obtener usuario actual (requiere token de master auth)
GET {{baseURL}}/master/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json
x-access-token: {{accesstoken}}

### ============================================

### Refrescar token de acceso
POST {{baseURL}}/master/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
x-refresh-token: {{refreshToken}}

{
    "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### ============================================

### Cambiar contraseña
POST {{baseURL}}/master/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
x-access-token: {{accesstoken}}

{
    "currentPassword": "password123",
    "newPassword": "newPassword456"
}
